@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Merchant system" as Merchant
actor "Customer" as Customer
rectangle "SubPay" as SubPay
rectangle "PSP" as PSP
Merchant --> SubPay : subscriptions / status / payments
Customer --> PSP : tokenization via hosted form/SDK
PSP --> Customer : payment method token
Merchant --> SubPay : provider token for customer
SubPay --> PSP : create payment / get status
PSP --> SubPay : signed webhook
@enduml
